4k wasn't happening, so Warma started with at least something. This is a few-
evening crapto.

Jyry note: The 'index.html.br' needs to be served by a web server for the
intro to work in its 1k form. The mechanism used is identical to the one used
by p01 and pestis in their Assembly 2023 1k intro "EXPI".

Execute the following command in the intro folder:

> python jeesi.py -s

This will serve the precompiled intro, click on the link in the terminal to
run. The address should be http://localhost:8080
